# ProveIt — local environment (CLI plugin)
# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored — your real keys never get committed.
# The cross-model review loads .env automatically (this dir, your project dir, or ~/proveit/.env).

# Enables the cross-model review (Phase 6 + 8) and DALL-E logo generation in BrandIt.
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Optional — override the cross-model reviewer (defaults track the current OpenAI frontier).
# PROVEIT_REVIEW_MODEL=gpt-5.5
# PROVEIT_REVIEW_EFFORT=high

# This is the only key ProveIt needs. The frontier-scan workflow runs in your
# Claude Code session on your Max plan — no API key required.
